1445:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h **** /** \defgroup IfxLld_Cpu_Intrinsics_Gnucsingle_assembly Insert Single Assembly Instruction
1446:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h ****  The next table provides an overview of the intrinsic functions that you can use to insert a single
1447:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h ****  instruction.You can also use inline assembly but these intrinsics provide a shorthand for frequent
1448:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/Tricore/Cpu/Std/IfxCpu_IntrinsicsGcc.h ****  assembly instructions.
